                <pb facs="0316" n="216" xml:id="pg216"/>

                <head>No. 140.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lowell to Mr. Frelinghuysen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 19,
                        1884</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Formal offer Alert from Government came this morning.</p>
                <p>Admiralty find many things wanting; from press of work can do nothing; but Greens
                    promise her in three weeks, with most of equipment.</p>
                <closer><signed>LOWELL,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Minister.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
